Prior to the events of The Champion, Hop assisted in battling against during the Darkest Day. While they were unable to defeat Eternatus on their own, they were soon joined by and . With the assistance of the Legendary Pokémon, they were able to weaken Eternatus enough for Victor to catch it and end the Darkest Day.

In the present day, Hop was at the Wyndon Stadium, cheering for Leon as he prepared to start his Championship Match against Victor.
